# Graph algorithms in ProgressTree

## Setup

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:progress_tree, path: "../progress_tree"}
])
```

> Run from repo root after `mix ecto.setup` in `progress_tree/`.

## Descendants CTE

```elixir
alias ProgressTree.Knowledge.Tree

# Replace with a real gene id from seeds
Tree.get_descendants(1, 5)
```

## Lineage path

```elixir
Tree.get_lineage_path(1)
```

## Bidirectional BFS

```elixir
alias ProgressTree.Genealogy.Walker

Walker.bidirectional_bfs(source_id, target_id)
```

Relation types in the graph:

| Type | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| наследование | Full rework of parent design |
| вдохновение | Methodology reused |
| сборка | Parent is a component |
| форк | Parallel branch |
